---
import '../styles/global.css';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en" data-theme="dark">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Privacy Policy | Ekwly</title>
    <link rel="icon" href="/ekwly/favicon.ico" type="image/x-icon" />
  </head>
  <body class="bg-page text-main antialiased selection:bg-primary-light selection:text-primary min-h-screen py-10 px-4 md:px-8">
    <main class="max-w-3xl mx-auto bg-surface border border-border rounded-2xl p-6 md:p-10 shadow-sm">
      <div class="mb-6 pb-4 border-b border-border flex items-center justify-between">
        <a
          href="/ekwly/"
          class="text-sm font-semibold text-primary hover:text-primary-hover transition-colors">
          ← Return to App
        </a>
        <span class="text-xs font-bold text-muted uppercase tracking-widest">Legal</span>
      </div>

      <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-main mb-2">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="text-sm text-muted mb-8">Effective Date: October 5, 2026</p>

      <section class="space-y-6 text-sm text-main/90 leading-relaxed">
        <div>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-main mb-2">1. Overview</h2>
          <p class="text-muted">
            Ekwly ("we", "our", or "us") provides a collaborative bill-splitting, itemization, and
            settlement platform. This Privacy Policy details how we collect, store, process, and
            safeguard your personal information when using our application across web, Progressive
            Web App (PWA), and native mobile wrappers in accordance with India's Digital Personal
            Data Protection Act (DPDPA) and international data protection standards.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-main mb-2">2. Data We Collect</h2>
          <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-1 text-muted">
            <li>
              <strong class="text-main">Authentication Information:</strong> Name, email address,
              and avatar URL provided via Supabase Auth or Google OAuth.
            </li>
            <li>
              <strong class="text-main">Profile & Payment Handles:</strong> Virtual Payment Address
              (UPI ID) optionally provided by you to enable peer-to-peer deep links (`upi://pay`).
            </li>
            <li>
              <strong class="text-main">Session Records:</strong> Item entries, custom tax
              configurations, room pins, claimed quantities, payment distribution ledgers, and
              friend connection IDs.
            </li>
            <li>
              <strong class="text-main">Camera & Receipts:</strong> Images captured specifically
              during the "Magic Scan" workflow for receipt text parsing.
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-main mb-2">
            3. AI Processing & Third-Party Disclosure
          </h2>
          <p class="text-muted mb-2">
            When you invoke the "Magic Scan" receipt reader, temporary image data is passed through
            a secure Supabase Edge Function to Google's Gemini Vision API solely for item and
            numeric extraction.
          </p>
          <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-1 text-muted">
            <li>Receipt images are not used for targeted consumer advertising.</li>
            <li>
              No biometric facial data, government identity documents, or financial account
              credentials are extracted or retained.
            </li>
            <li>
              Database persistence is managed strictly via PostgreSQL on Supabase with Row Level
              Security (RLS) enforcement.
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-main mb-2">4. Data Retention & Deletion Rights</h2>
          <p class="text-muted">
            Your personal profile, associated ledger history, and active session data are maintained
            as long as your account remains active. You maintain the right to view, correct, or
            permanently delete your stored information at any time via in-app profile settings or
            through our external data deletion portal at{' '}
            <a href="/ekwly/delete-account" class="text-primary hover:underline font-semibold">
              /ekwly/delete-account
            </a>
            .
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-main mb-2">5. Contact Information</h2>
          <p class="text-muted">
            For inquiries, privacy notices, or data handling requests, reach out to our team at{' '}
            <span class="font-mono text-main">support@ekwly.app</span>.
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
